  "date": "2026-11-10T17:38:14Z",
  "message": "FEShader::GetUniform now looks up uniform once, previously it called find and then operator[], so every found uniform was hashed twice; FEShader::GetUniform, UpdateUniformData, LoadUniformDataToGPU and GetUniformData now take uniform name as const std::string&; Added FEShader::FindUniform, it returns nullptr without logging warning when shader does not have uniform; FEShader::GetUniform and HasUniform now use FEShader::FindUniform; FERenderer::LoadStandardUniforms now gets each uniform once with FEShader::FindUniform and sets its value directly.",
